(text "NT430 / NT431 / NT432: place at U1 supply pads. Copper ties, no assembled parts.\n100R resistors remain at the regulator output banks; route each FB trace separately from U1.\nKeep FB away from switching nodes. See Rockchip tablet reference p22." (at 15.24 254 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ee4c8aba-9132-551e-bd52-a3561edfc9d2"))
(text "2 x 22uF local input; 3 x 22uF + 100nF local output per buck. Processor bypass is separate.\nEnforce RK3568B2 voltage limits in firmware: LOGIC <=0.99V; GPU/NPU <=1.10V." (at 15.24 276.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d205bc0b-6dfb-5e78-8168-f9ec70ca5396"))
)
